      "writtenOn": "2021-07-16T03:40:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Excellent. This is a good example to demo the benefit of dedicated SSC class. It removes the restriction when handling logic in SST and brings space to improvements in various ways (readability, performance, maintenance...).\n\nI\u0027ve record the idea in https://b.corp.google.com/issues/178429976#comment4 and plan to do it in a separate CL.\n\nStrategically, I planned to firstly land SSC with no functional change to minimize the risk and review burden. \nThanks!",
