      "writtenOn": "2021-07-14T02:25:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I notice that the assumptions and ordering are a little different here. Is it possible for onCompleted to be null for this case and not for the request case? Why is it nullable here?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 128,
        "startChar": 20,
