      "message": "Yeah. onCompleted Message in method setSignalStrengthUpdateRequest is @NonNull while @Nullable in method clearSignalStrengthUpdateRequest.\n\nWhen client died, clearSignalStrengthUpdateRequest is called with null onCompleted Message in SignalRequestRecord#binderDied. Since the request is not from client/PIM, we don\u0027t need a onCompleted msg to notify the requester.",
